🚢 Deployment
Option 1: Docker Compose (Recommended)
bash
docker-compose up -d
Option 2: Render / Railway
Push code to GitHub

Create a new web service, connect repo

Set environment variables (DB, Redis, Secret Key)

Deploy

Option 3: AWS (EC2 + RDS)
Launch EC2 instance (Ubuntu 22.04, t3.medium)

Install Docker, PostgreSQL RDS, ElastiCache Redis

Run docker-compose up -d

Set up Nginx as reverse proxy

